sequenceDiagram
  actor RE as Reporting Entity
  actor CA as Competent Authority
  actor SA as Supervisory Authority
  loop Capture all Relevant Messages
  RE->>CA: FinancialInstrumentReportingEquityTransparencyDataReport<br/>OR<br/>FinancialInstrumentReportingNonEquityTransparencyDataReport
  alt Message Received Correctly — All data is correct
  CA->>RE: FinancialInstrumentReportingStatusAdvice
  CA->>SA: FinancialInstrumentReportingEquityTransparencyDataReport<br/>OR<br/>FinancialInstrumentReportingNonEquityTransparencyDataReport
  else Some data errors
  CA->>RE: FinancialInstrumentReportingStatusAdvice
  alt Instruments with no Errors
  CA->>SA: FinancialInstrumentReportingEquityTransparencyDataReport<br/>OR<br/>FinancialInstrumentReportingNonEquityTransparencyDataReport
  end
  end
  end
  alt Message Received Correctly — All data is correct
  SA->>CA: FinancialInstrumentReportingStatusAdvice
  else Some data errors
  SA->>CA: FinancialInstrumentReportingStatusAdvice
  CA->>RE: FinancialInstrumentReportingStatusAdvice
  end
